        "color_scheme_2": "background-1",
        "heading": "<p>We Are LA LOOP</p>",
        "subheading": "<p>In 1999, LA LOOP introduced something entirely new: the necklace for eyewear. What began as a simple idea — to keep glasses close at hand without compromising style — became a patented design that redefined accessories. <br/></p><p>That originality caught the eye of a buyer at the Museum of Modern Art (MoMA) Design Store, who recognized LA LOOP not just as an accessory, but as an invention. From that moment, LA LOOP’s place as a design-driven brand was solidified. What started in Los Angeles quickly grew beyond borders — today, LA LOOP can be found in select stores across 28 countries, connecting a global community of LOOPERS who value accessories that blend style and function. <br/></p><p>More than two decades later, LA LOOP continues to lead with innovation and timeless design, proving that style and function can not only coexist — they can define an entire category.</p>",
        "subheading_left_top": "",
        "subheading_left_bottom": "",
        "subheading_right_top": "",
        "subheading_right_bottom": "",
        "button_text": "DISCOVER OUR CRAFT",
        "button_link": "#",
        "button_style": "link",
        "margin_top": 0,
        "margin_bottom": 0
      }
