        "image_before": "shopify://shop_images/about-before.jpg",
        "image_after": "shopify://shop_images/about-after.jpg",
        "product_list_compare": [],
        "heading": "<h2>Our Craft</h2><p>At LA LOOP, every detail matters. Each piece starts with intention: What role will it play in someone’s life? How can it blend ease with elegance? </p><p>We source premium materials from trusted makers around the world — supple leathers, modern acetate, sterling and plated silver, luminous gold, and hand-strung beads in vibrant textures. </p><p>Each design is brought to life with our patented swiveling hinges, engineered to hold eyewear securely while offering effortless comfort. </p><p>Our artisans bring decades of skill to every step, from meticulous hand-finishing to precision assembly. The result is jewelry you live in — timeless, durable, and designed to move with you, day after day.</p>",
        "subheading_left_top": "BEFORE/AFTER",
        "subheading_right_top": "",
        "button_text": "SHOP ALL",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections",
