        "frame-text-right": "",
        "color_scheme_2": "background-1",
        "heading": "<p>Our Founder</p>",
        "subheading": "<p><strong>“I’ve always been about connection.” — Elizabeth Faraut </strong><br/></p><p>When Elizabeth Faraut launched LA LOOP, she wasn’t trying to follow trends — she was creating something the world hadn’t seen before. With her background in fashion and her eye for clean, functional design, she invented a way to turn eyewear into jewelry.<br/></p><p>For Elizabeth, LA LOOP has always been more than an accessory. It’s a symbol of connection — connecting fashion and function, craftsmanship and community, people and purpose. From the very beginning, she believed that an accessory could do more than complete an outfit; it could carry meaning, spark conversation, and even create impact in the world. <br/></p><p>Today, Elizabeth’s vision continues to guide the brand. LA LOOP is not just about keeping your glasses close — it’s about keeping connection close.</p>",
        "subheading_left_top": "",
        "subheading_left_bottom": "",
        "subheading_right_top": "",
        "subheading_right_bottom": "",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "#",
